From 51d9fd646b0a71a795c31c9903aec8e6e1d0610f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:16:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Document the LG Fx0

Add the LG Fx0 (Madai) to the MSM8926 compatible list. Its existing board
description uses lg,madai followed by qcom,msm8926 and qcom,msm8226,
matching the other MSM8926 handsets in this binding.

The original local proposal by Timothy Schmidt is
933d3593e3abf43752e0d7f858a0d9b98cb06744 ("dt-bindings: arm: qcom:
Document LG Fx0"). Retain its author and date while carrying the same
entry onto the current Qualcomm maintainer for-next tree.

Prepared and checked with Codex:GPT-6 assistance. Human review and
Developer Certificate of Origin sign-off remain pending.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 7ffa4f699..95cb9bdb1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -255,6 +255,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - htc,memul
+              - lg,madai
               - microsoft,superman-lte
               - microsoft,tesla
               - motorola,peregrine
-- 
2.56.0

